# Everything here is output, and all of it is reproducible from the source beside it:
#   node shoot.mjs --print         prints the nine capture commands verbatim
#   node score/render.mjs          re-renders the wav and the stems
# Committing 38 MB of mp4 and wav to hold artifacts a command regenerates is the same mistake as
# committing a build. It is also the mistake this kit is loudest about not making anywhere else.
shots/
score/*.wav
score/*.png
